  "Intuitive Attachment Process for Customers": "Intuïtief bijlageproces voor klanten",
  "Designed with user experience in mind, the Checkout Attachment Module makes adding attachments a straightforward and hassle-free process. During checkout, customers are presented with an easy-to-use interface to upload their files. Supported file types and size limits can be configured to suit your business needs, ensuring compatibility and efficiency. This user-friendly approach helps reduce friction in the checkout process, leading to higher customer satisfaction and fewer order discrepancies.": "De Checkout Attachment Module is ontworpen met het oog op de gebruikerservaring en maakt het toevoegen van bijlagen een eenvoudig en probleemloos proces. ",
  "Enhanced Communication with Administrators": "Verbeterde communicatie met beheerders",
  "Once a customer adds an attachment, it becomes immediately visible to the admin on the backend. This feature is particularly useful for businesses that require additional documentation to process orders accurately. Admins can easily access, review, and manage these attachments through the eCommerceGo admin panel. This seamless integration ensures that all relevant information is at the admin fingertips, facilitating smoother order processing and better customer service.": "Zodra een klant een bijlage toevoegt, wordt deze direct zichtbaar voor de beheerder op de backend. ",
